	// - `invalid_oidc_settings`
	// - `oidc_discovery_failed`, `oidc_issuer_mismatch`, `oidc_keys_failed`: testing a provider (502)
	// - `sso_state_invalid`, `sso_denied`, `sso_provider_error`, `sso_token_invalid`,
